The air quality measurements and forecasts come from Airly
(https://airly.org), through the Airly API (https://developer.airly.org).
Data provided by Airly, used under the terms of service of the Airly API.

The files under test/fixtures are answers of the Airly API v2:
  - measurements_point.json and measurements_no_station.json come from the
    tests of the Home Assistant integration "airly"
    (https://github.com/home-assistant/core, Apache License 2.0);
  - measurements_installation.json and installations_nearest.json come from
    the tests of the Python library "airly"
    (https://github.com/ak-ambi/python-airly, MIT licence,
    Copyright (c) 2019 Paweł Stankowski).

